 "source_type": "instagram",
 "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfzqdAYqguP/",
 "title": "How to Speak with Confidence in Sales",
 "topic": "sales",
 "summary": "The creator advises that sales confidence does not require courses or deep experience. Instead, salespeople should treat clients like friends, focus on understanding their requirements, and explain projects in a natural, conversational way.",
 "key_points": [
  "Confidence does not require taking courses or having extensive experience.",
  "Understand the client's expectations, requirements, and what they are looking for in the market.",
  "Ask questions in a way that makes the client feel like they are talking to a friend or family member.",
  "Position yourself as someone who will help them out and get them out of problems in the market.",
  "Start the conversation by asking: Sir, you tell me about your expectations, what are you expecting the most?",
  "Explain the project to the client the same way you would teach or explain something to a friend in a proper and mannered way.",
  "Do not worry or overthink; remember you have a good luxury segment and reputation in your hand.",
  "Be comfortable with the client and make them comfortable first so they trust you the most.",
  "Be transparent sometimes, as transparency is key to gaining the client's trust."
 ],
 "content": "Basic things to understand when are you are selling something! \n\nSee, I'll tell you one thing, confidence is not something which you have to do some course and all. You have to be more experienced and all. I'll give you one basic idea. If you want to know or understand a client, simple thing you have to do is just understand his expectations, understand what he is looking for, understand his requirements, that is it. And when you ask him some questions, ask him in a way he is like your friend, he is like your family member or something. Do not be scared. He has come to you to buy a property. You are looking for property in the market, you are somebody who is going to help him out. You have to make sure that, sir, if you want to buy something in market, I am the one who can get you some good property. I am the one who can get you out of any problem you are going to face in the [unclear]. This is the most important thing you should focus on. What do I do on my table? Sir, you tell me about your expectations. What are you expecting the most? The first question ask is this. Then he will tell, bro, I am looking for this, I am looking for that, this is my expectations. Then you have to tell him about the project. The way you speak is very important, tell about the project in a way you are teaching somebody or you are trying to make him explain like he is your friend or something, same thing you have to do, do not be worried, do not think too much. Your project is luxury, you have good segment in your hand, reputation in your hand, why are you worrying about it? It is very basic, you just have to explain him the project as you are explaining to your friend, that's it, in a very proper and mannered way, nothing else you have to do. It is not a rocket science to get an good confidence, speak. Be comfortable with him. Make him comfortable first. If he is comfortable around you, he'll trust you most. And be transparent sometimes. Because being transparent is also a key to get his trust.",
